There is a very large oak tree here with branches stretching to the sky.	這裡有一棵非常高大的橡樹，枝椏向天空伸展。
This is a relatively low, rustic stone fence which runs along the left and rear sides of the garden.	這是一道相對低矮、質樸的石牆，沿著花園的左側和後側延伸。
There is no reason to climb the fence.	沒有理由要爬這道圍籬。
You can go around the fence.	你可以繞過這道圍籬。
You do not have a carrot to eat.	你身上沒有胡蘿蔔可以吃。
You see an old stone wall surrounding a well kept garden.	你看見一道古老的石牆，圍繞著一座整理得很好的花園。
This is a neat little carrot patch.  The plump carrots  look tempting.	這是一小片整齊的胡蘿蔔園，飽滿的胡蘿蔔看起來十分誘人。
It is a relatively low, native stone and masonry fence to the right and rear of a garden.	這是一道相對低矮的天然石砌圍籬，位於花園的右側和後側。
You pluck a delicious looking carrot from the fertile soil.	你從肥沃的土壤裡拔起一根看起來美味的胡蘿蔔。
They are buried in the ground.  You must get closer to see them.	它們埋在地底下，你得靠近一點才能看清楚。
You cannot do that from here.	你在這裡沒辦法這麼做。
You carefully fill the bucket with water.	你小心翼翼地把水桶裝滿了水。
This is a clear mountain lake with some steep cliffs surrounding it.	這是一座清澈的山中湖泊，四周環繞著陡峭的懸崖。
Wandering on the banks of the lake, you see a cute little elf.	你在湖畔漫步，看見一個可愛的小精靈。
The cold water gushes into the old bucket.	冰冷的水湧進了那個舊水桶。
There is nothing to compare with that refreshing taste.	沒有什麼比得上那沁涼的滋味。
There is a very pretty lake nearby with a small little elf running along its shore.	附近有一座非常美麗的湖泊，一個嬌小的小精靈正沿著湖岸奔跑。
This is a small elf.  He looks very friendly.	這是一個嬌小的小精靈，看起來十分友善。
There's no elf here.	這裡沒有小精靈。
The elf, impressed by your friendliness, gives you a magic ring.  "Kind person, know that once, only once, this ring will make you invisible," he says and then disappears.	小精靈被你的友善打動，送你一枚魔戒。他說：「善良的人啊，記住，這枚戒指只能讓你隱形一次，僅僅一次。」說完便消失無蹤。
The elf has left since you were not very cordial to him.	由於你對他不夠親切，小精靈已經離開了。
There is a clear mountain lake and some trees here.	這裡有一座清澈的山中湖泊和幾棵樹。
It is a huge wooden door built right into the bottom of a small mountain!  It has a large keyhole.	這是一扇巨大的木門，直接嵌建在一座小山的山腳下！門上有一個大鎖孔。
You can't fool me!  You don't have a key.	你騙不了我！你身上沒有鑰匙。
The door is already unlocked.	這扇門已經解鎖了。
Using the gold key, you unlock the huge door.	你用金鑰匙打開了這扇巨大的門。
The door is already locked.	這扇門已經鎖上了。
You lock the massive door with the heavy gold key.	你用那把沉重的金鑰匙把這扇巨大的門鎖上了。
You need a key to do that.	你需要一把鑰匙才能這麼做。
You strike the door with all your might!  To no avail.	你使盡全力猛擊這扇門！卻毫無用處。
There aren't many keyholes in the ground here.	這裡的地上沒有幾個鎖孔。
There seems to be a door built into the mountainside.	山腰上似乎有一扇門。
There is no need to unlock an already open door.	門已經開著了，沒有必要解鎖。
You need to close the door before you can lock it.	你得先把門關上，才能把它鎖上。
The door is already open.	這扇門已經開著了。
You fill up your bucket with sparkling water.	你把水桶裝滿了晶瑩的水。
This is a small alpine lake.	這是一座小小的高山湖泊。
It's a witch swooping through the sky... She's trying to catch you!  Look out!	是一個巫婆從天而降……她想抓住你！小心！
There is a witch in the area, but since you have that menacing goat with you, she will keep her distance.	這一帶有巫婆出沒，但因為你帶著那隻凶猛的山羊，她會保持距離。
There is a witch in the area, but with the shield no harm will come to you.	這一帶有巫婆出沒，但有了靈盾，你不會受到任何傷害。
Jumping here would put you in even greater danger from that witch!	在這裡跳躍會讓你陷入那個巫婆帶來的更大危險之中！
Your protection is gone and you best look out for the witch!	你的防護已經消失了，最好小心那個巫婆！
With the goat now dead, you are fair game for the witch.	山羊已經死了，你現在成了巫婆眼中的獵物。
There's no witch here.	這裡沒有巫婆。
There is no way to kill a flying witch!	沒有辦法殺死一個會飛的巫婆！
The witch swoops down, grabs you by the neck, and carries you off to a fate worse than death.	巫婆俯衝而下，一把抓住你的脖子，把你帶去承受比死更慘的下場。
The witch missed you, this time.	這一次，巫婆沒抓到你。
The witch can feel your protective spell and bids a hasty retreat.	巫婆感應到你身上的守護魔法，匆忙撤退了。
Lucky for you that you are invisible, the witch can't find you.	幸好你是隱形的，巫婆找不到你。
There is no way you can now.	你現在沒辦法這麼做。
There is no reason to jump now.	現在沒有理由要跳。
Oh NO!!  She's back!!!	喔不！！她回來了！！！
High up in the sky you see a very large, friendly bird.	你看見天空高處有一隻非常巨大、友善的鳥。
This is a big condor.  Its graceful flight appears effortless.	這是一隻大兀鷲，牠的飛行姿態優雅、毫不費力。
There is no bird.	這裡沒有鳥。
The bird is too high to kill.  Besides, it looks like a nice bird.	這隻鳥飛得太高了，殺不到。再說，牠看起來是隻善良的鳥。
You would hit your head on the top of the cave if you jumped now!	你要是現在跳起來，會撞到洞穴頂部！
High up in the sky you see a very large, friendly bird, but it is afraid to come near you because of the goat.	你看見天空高處有一隻非常巨大、友善的鳥，但因為那隻山羊，牠不敢靠近你。
Where could this giant bird be taking you?	這隻巨鳥會把你帶到哪裡去呢？
This bird doesn't talk much.	這隻鳥不太愛說話。
The clear mountain water pours into the bucket.	清澈的山泉水注入了水桶。
Ahhh!  That water sure hit the spot!	啊～那口水喝得真是暢快！
You see the mountains and trees reflected in the mirror-like water.	你看見群山與樹木倒映在如鏡般的水面上。
These cattails look soft and fuzzy.	這些香蒲看起來又軟又毛茸茸的。
There is a small patch of clover under the tree.	樹下有一小片三葉草。
Off in the distance you see a patch of clover.	在遠處，你看見一片三葉草叢。
You already have the only four-leaf clover here.	你已經拿到這裡唯一的幸運草了。
The clover is soft, yet you sense a strange strength in it.	這株幸運草很柔軟，但你感覺到它裡頭蘊藏著一股奇異的力量。
You really don't want any of the three-leaf clovers.	你其實不會想要任何三葉草。
You had, and lost, the only four-leaf clover  around.  You really don't want a three-leaf clover.	你原本擁有這附近唯一的幸運草，卻弄丟了。你其實不會想要一株三葉草。
There is a clover patch in this meadow.	這片草地上有一片三葉草。
As you start to cross the bridge, a wretched troll appears.	你正要走上橋時，一個可惡的矮精靈出現了。
It is a well known fact that goats hate trolls intensely. You should move aside and let the goat take care of this nasty troll.	眾所皆知，山羊對矮精靈恨之入骨。你應該讓到一旁，讓山羊去對付這隻討厭的矮精靈。
This is the ugliest, meanest troll I have ever seen.	這是我見過最醜陋、最兇惡的矮精靈。
This troll is a real fighter.  Better not even try it.	這隻矮精靈很能打，你最好想都別想。
Fortunately for you, you have nothing to kill the  troll with.	算你幸運，你身上沒有能殺死矮精靈的東西。
The troll demands a treasure for passage across his bridge.	矮精靈要求你交出一件寶物，才准你通過他的橋。
You throw the dagger and the old -- but quick -- troll catches it.  Now what are your plans?	你擲出短刀，那隻上了年紀卻手腳俐落的矮精靈接住了它。你現在打算怎麼辦？
You push the troll as hard as you can but he doesn't budge an inch.	你使盡全力推那隻矮精靈，可惜他紋風不動。
The troll has a heart of stone.	這隻矮精靈鐵石心腸。
The troll appears to be upset about your attempt to cross his bridge.	矮精靈似乎對你試圖跨過他的橋感到不悅。
Trolls have bad hearing, so you will have to get closer.	矮精靈的聽力不好，你得再靠近一點。
You throw, and lose the dagger.	你擲了出去，短刀就這麼弄丟了。
There is no troll around here.	這附近沒有矮精靈。
What type of treasure would you like to give the old troll?	你想給這隻老矮精靈什麼樣的寶物？
You have no treasure to give the troll.	你沒有寶物可以給矮精靈。
You can't give it if you don't have it.	你沒有的東西，沒辦法給人。
The troll doesn't want just a plain walnut.	矮精靈才不要一顆普通的胡桃。
You are not close enough to the river.	你離河邊不夠近。
This is an old, rickety bridge.	這是一座老舊、搖搖欲墜的橋。
This placid looking stream is actually quite dangerous... the current is stronger than it looks.  You can't keep your head above water.	這條看似平靜的溪流其實相當危險……水流比看起來湍急得多。你的頭沒辦法一直露出水面。
The troll greedily grabs the treasure and disappears  under the bridge.	矮精靈貪婪地一把抓過寶物，消失在橋下。
The goat butts the troll right off the bridge, never to be seen in these parts again.	山羊一頭把矮精靈頂下橋，從此再也沒人在這一帶見過他。
You could never win a fight with a troll.	你不可能打贏矮精靈。
As you start to cross the bridge, a wretched troll appears.  Even though you are invisible, he will not let you cross his bridge.	你正要走上橋時，一個可惡的矮精靈出現了。即使你是隱形的，他也不會讓你跨過他的橋。
This placid looking stream is actually quite dangerous.... the current is stronger than it looks.  You can't keep your head above water.	這條看似平靜的溪流其實相當危險……水流比看起來湍急得多。你的頭沒辦法一直露出水面。
The bank is too steep to allow access to the river's edge.	河岸太陡了，沒辦法靠近河邊。
It is old and rotted.	它又老舊又腐朽。
There is an attractive meadow dotted with trees.	這裡有一片迷人的草地，點綴著幾棵樹。
It is just a hole in an empty, old stump.	那只是一個空心老樹樁上的洞。
What are you doing that for?  There's nothing here.	你這麼做是為了什麼？這裡什麼也沒有。
You must be getting nervous!  I see no witch here!	你一定是緊張過頭了！我在這裡沒看到什麼巫婆！
The windows are made from translucent, hardened sugar.  It's difficult to see through them.	這些窗戶是用半透明的硬糖做成的，很難透過它們看清楚。
The windows are hard to break.	這些窗戶很難打破。
This is the sweetest little gingerbread house you ever saw.  The walls are cake, the roof is frosting, the chimney looks delicious, and the candy path and cookie fence are unbearably tempting!	這是你見過最甜美的小薑餅屋。牆壁是蛋糕做的，屋頂是糖霜，煙囪看起來也是美味可口，糖果小徑和餅乾圍籬更是誘人得讓人受不了！
The house looks tempting, but you need to get closer.	這間房子看起來很誘人，但你得靠近一點。
The goat is suspicious of this witch's house and  refuses to go in.	山羊對這間巫婆的房子起了疑心，不肯進去。
The door is made from graham crackers held together  with chocolate drop nails.	這扇門是用全麥餅乾做的，用巧克力豆當釘子固定住。
The path is around the corner.	小徑在轉角那邊。
Be careful!  Nearby is a sorcerer.  His mystical powers can leave you immobilized and helpless!	小心！附近有個巫師。他的神秘力量能讓你動彈不得、無力反抗！
The magic shield will protect you from this dangerous  sorcerer.	靈盾能保護你免受這個危險巫師的傷害。
You're so afraid of the sorcerer that your knees are locked.	你太害怕這個巫師了，雙腳都僵住動不了。
This sorcerer exudes mystery and danger.	這個巫師散發著神秘又危險的氣息。
There's no sorcerer here.	這裡沒有巫師。
The sorcerer casts a spell, freezing you to the spot. I hope no dangerous creatures drop by!	巫師施了一道法術，把你定在原地動彈不得。希望別有什麼危險的生物剛好經過！
The sorcerer's spell has expired; now you can move  again.  Whew!	巫師的法術已經失效了，你現在又能動了。呼！
You are immobilized!  You can't jump or duck now!	你被定住了！現在沒辦法跳躍或蹲下！
OK.  But you just lost your dagger.	好吧。不過你剛剛弄丟了短刀。
The sorcerer only speaks in the language of the Mystics.	這個巫師只說神秘族的語言。
This sorcerer's magic is no match for your fairy godmother's.	這個巫師的法力比不上你教母的法力。
The sorcerer sees the goat and decides to leave.	巫師看見那隻山羊，決定離開。
Being invisible has protected you from this sorcerer.	隱形保護了你，讓這個巫師傷不到你。
These are some of the finest walnuts you have ever seen.	這些是你見過最上等的胡桃。
You look around and decide these plain walnuts won't do. You want a gold walnut!	你環顧四周，覺得這些普通的胡桃不合用。你要的是金胡桃！
You pluck a nice walnut from the tree.	你從樹上摘下一顆漂亮的胡桃。
They are very small and hard to see from here.	它們很小，從這裡很難看清楚。
The walnuts are over by the walnut tree.	胡桃就在那棵胡桃樹旁邊。
This is a very colorful ceramic bowl.	這是一個色彩繽紛的陶碗。
You pick up the ceramic bowl.	你撿起了那個陶碗。
It looks like an interesting, colorful bowl.	這看起來是個有趣又色彩繽紛的碗。
